  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed first floor extension, by reason of its design and form, would result in an awkward addition, failing to blend and integrate well with the main building and its surroundings and would have a negative impact toward the character and appearance of the dwellinghouse. The proposal would be contrary to policy CS 14 of the Merton LDF Core Planning Strategy (2011), policies DM D2 and DM D3 of the Merton Sites and Policies Plan (2014) and policy D4 of the London Plan 2021.  "
